{"schema_version": "rf.primitives-segment-item.v1", "item_id": "x6c6ecd74954a", "language": "ru", "messages": [{"message_id": "sg-08-m1", "author": "a", "text": "Ты дома?", "timestamp": 1701400000}, {"message_id": "sg-08-m2", "author": "b", "text": "Да, только зашёл.", "timestamp": 1701400120}, {"message_id": "sg-08-m3", "author": "a", "text": "Хорошо, я через полчаса.", "timestamp": 1701400180}, {"message_id": "sg-08-m4", "author": "b", "text": "Жду.", "timestamp": 1701400240}, {"message_id": "sg-08-m5", "author": "a", "text": "Возьму что-нибудь поесть.", "timestamp": 1701400360}, {"message_id": "sg-08-m6", "author": "b", "text": "Отлично.", "timestamp": 1701400420}], "candidate_boundaries": ["sg-08-m1|sg-08-m2", "sg-08-m2|sg-08-m3", "sg-08-m3|sg-08-m4", "sg-08-m4|sg-08-m5", "sg-08-m5|sg-08-m6"]}
{"schema_version": "rf.primitives-segment-item.v1", "item_id": "xaf629f063432", "language": "ru", "messages": [{"message_id": "sg-05-m1", "author": "a", "text": "Ты вчера ушёл посреди разговора.", "timestamp": 1700800000}, {"message_id": "sg-05-m2", "author": "b", "text": "Мне надо было выйти, я был на взводе.", "timestamp": 1700800120}, {"message_id": "sg-05-m3", "author": "a", "text": "Я не поняла, что происходит.", "timestamp": 1700800180}, {"message_id": "sg-05-m4", "author": "b", "text": "Прости. Надо было сказать.", "timestamp": 1700800300}, {"message_id": "sg-05-m5", "author": "a", "text": "Спасибо. В следующий раз просто скажи.", "timestamp": 1700800420}, {"message_id": "sg-05-m6", "author": "b", "text": "Договорились.", "timestamp": 1700800480}, {"message_id": "sg-05-m7", "author": "a", "text": "Во сколько завтра машина?", "timestamp": 1700802280}, {"message_id": "sg-05-m8", "author": "b", "text": "К девяти подадут.", "timestamp": 1700802400}], "candidate_boundaries": ["sg-05-m1|sg-05-m2", "sg-05-m2|sg-05-m3", "sg-05-m3|sg-05-m4", "sg-05-m4|sg-05-m5", "sg-05-m5|sg-05-m6", "sg-05-m6|sg-05-m7", "sg-05-m7|sg-05-m8"]}
{"schema_version": "rf.primitives-segment-item.v1", "item_id": "x49f3241a2307", "language": "en", "messages": [{"message_id": "sg-04-m1", "author": "a", "text": "Can we talk about the money thing?", "timestamp": 1700600000}, {"message_id": "sg-04-m2", "author": "b", "text": "Yeah. Give me an hour, I'm in a meeting.", "timestamp": 1700600120}, {"message_id": "sg-04-m3", "author": "a", "text": "Sure.", "timestamp": 1700600180}, {"message_id": "sg-04-m4", "author": "b", "text": "Okay, I'm free now. So about the money.", "timestamp": 1700607380}, {"message_id": "sg-04-m5", "author": "a", "text": "I just want us to agree a limit.", "timestamp": 1700607500}, {"message_id": "sg-04-m6", "author": "b", "text": "That seems fair.", "timestamp": 1700607620}, {"message_id": "sg-04-m7", "author": "a", "text": "Then let's write it down somewhere.", "timestamp": 1700607740}, {"message_id": "sg-04-m8", "author": "b", "text": "Deal.", "timestamp": 1700607800}], "candidate_boundaries": ["sg-04-m1|sg-04-m2", "sg-04-m2|sg-04-m3", "sg-04-m3|sg-04-m4", "sg-04-m4|sg-04-m5", "sg-04-m5|sg-04-m6", "sg-04-m6|sg-04-m7", "sg-04-m7|sg-04-m8"]}
{"schema_version": "rf.primitives-segment-item.v1", "item_id": "xdf14439b0495", "language": "ru", "messages": [{"message_id": "sg-01-m1", "author": "a", "text": "Ты забрал вещи из химчистки?", "timestamp": 1700000000}, {"message_id": "sg-01-m2", "author": "b", "text": "Ой, нет. Завтра заберу.", "timestamp": 1700000120}, {"message_id": "sg-01-m3", "author": "a", "text": "Ты это уже третий раз откладываешь.", "timestamp": 1700000180}, {"message_id": "sg-01-m4", "author": "b", "text": "Знаю. Извини, правда закручусь и забываю.", "timestamp": 1700000360}, {"message_id": "sg-01-m5", "author": "a", "text": "Ладно, просто напомни себе как-нибудь.", "timestamp": 1700000480}, {"message_id": "sg-01-m6", "author": "b", "text": "Слушай, а что с отпуском решаем?", "timestamp": 1700036480}, {"message_id": "sg-01-m7", "author": "a", "text": "Я думала про конец августа.", "timestamp": 1700036720}, {"message_id": "sg-01-m8", "author": "b", "text": "Мне августа норм. Давай смотреть билеты.", "timestamp": 1700036900}, {"message_id": "sg-01-m9", "author": "a", "text": "Ок, вечером сядем.", "timestamp": 1700037020}], "candidate_boundaries": ["sg-01-m1|sg-01-m2", "sg-01-m2|sg-01-m3", "sg-01-m3|sg-01-m4", "sg-01-m4|sg-01-m5", "sg-01-m5|sg-01-m6", "sg-01-m6|sg-01-m7", "sg-01-m7|sg-01-m8", "sg-01-m8|sg-01-m9"]}
{"schema_version": "rf.primitives-segment-item.v1", "item_id": "x0cc00c7432a1", "language": "ru", "messages": [{"message_id": "sg-03-m1", "author": "a", "text": "Купила корм коту.", "timestamp": 1700400000}, {"message_id": "sg-03-m2", "author": "b", "text": "О, спасибо.", "timestamp": 1700400060}, {"message_id": "sg-03-m3", "author": "a", "text": "Ещё звонили из банка.", "timestamp": 1700400120}, {"message_id": "sg-03-m4", "author": "b", "text": "Что хотели?", "timestamp": 1700400180}, {"message_id": "sg-03-m5", "author": "a", "text": "Карту перевыпустить.", "timestamp": 1700400240}, {"message_id": "sg-03-m6", "author": "b", "text": "Понял. Кстати, мама зовёт в воскресенье.", "timestamp": 1700400300}, {"message_id": "sg-03-m7", "author": "a", "text": "Я не смогу, работа.", "timestamp": 1700400360}, {"message_id": "sg-03-m8", "author": "b", "text": "Ладно, скажу ей.", "timestamp": 1700400420}], "candidate_boundaries": ["sg-03-m1|sg-03-m2", "sg-03-m2|sg-03-m3", "sg-03-m3|sg-03-m4", "sg-03-m4|sg-03-m5", "sg-03-m5|sg-03-m6", "sg-03-m6|sg-03-m7", "sg-03-m7|sg-03-m8"]}
{"schema_version": "rf.primitives-segment-item.v1", "item_id": "x8df573e2f04e", "language": "en", "messages": [{"message_id": "sg-07-m1", "author": "a", "text": "I'm heading home, want anything?", "timestamp": 1701200000}, {"message_id": "sg-07-m2", "author": "b", "text": "Bread would be great.", "timestamp": 1701200120}, {"message_id": "sg-07-m3", "author": "a", "text": "Got it.", "timestamp": 1701200180}, {"message_id": "sg-07-m4", "author": "b", "text": "Morning. Did you sleep okay?", "timestamp": 1701254180}, {"message_id": "sg-07-m5", "author": "a", "text": "Not really, weird dreams.", "timestamp": 1701254360}, {"message_id": "sg-07-m6", "author": "b", "text": "Same here actually.", "timestamp": 1701254480}, {"message_id": "sg-07-m7", "author": "a", "text": "Coffee then.", "timestamp": 1701254600}, {"message_id": "sg-07-m8", "author": "b", "text": "Definitely coffee.", "timestamp": 1701254660}], "candidate_boundaries": ["sg-07-m1|sg-07-m2", "sg-07-m2|sg-07-m3", "sg-07-m3|sg-07-m4", "sg-07-m4|sg-07-m5", "sg-07-m5|sg-07-m6", "sg-07-m6|sg-07-m7", "sg-07-m7|sg-07-m8"]}
{"schema_version": "rf.primitives-segment-item.v1", "item_id": "xe9cdb61b6de0", "language": "ru", "messages": [{"message_id": "sg-06-m1", "author": "a", "text": "Надо решить с ремонтом в ванной.", "timestamp": 1701000000}, {"message_id": "sg-06-m2", "author": "b", "text": "Да, давно пора.", "timestamp": 1701000120}, {"message_id": "sg-06-m3", "author": "b", "text": "Ой, у меня чайник кипит, секунду.", "timestamp": 1701000180}, {"message_id": "sg-06-m4", "author": "a", "text": "Ок.", "timestamp": 1701000240}, {"message_id": "sg-06-m5", "author": "b", "text": "Всё, вернулся.", "timestamp": 1701000420}, {"message_id": "sg-06-m6", "author": "b", "text": "Так что по ванной — плитку меняем целиком?", "timestamp": 1701000480}, {"message_id": "sg-06-m7", "author": "a", "text": "Думаю да, частично будет видно стык.", "timestamp": 1701000600}, {"message_id": "sg-06-m8", "author": "b", "text": "Согласен.", "timestamp": 1701000660}], "candidate_boundaries": ["sg-06-m1|sg-06-m2", "sg-06-m2|sg-06-m3", "sg-06-m3|sg-06-m4", "sg-06-m4|sg-06-m5", "sg-06-m5|sg-06-m6", "sg-06-m6|sg-06-m7", "sg-06-m7|sg-06-m8"]}
{"schema_version": "rf.primitives-segment-item.v1", "item_id": "x0eb947efae08", "language": "ru", "messages": [{"message_id": "sg-02-m1", "author": "a", "text": "Меня напрягает, что ты опять не сказал про поездку.", "timestamp": 1700200000}, {"message_id": "sg-02-m2", "author": "b", "text": "Я думал, ты знаешь.", "timestamp": 1700200120}, {"message_id": "sg-02-m3", "author": "a", "text": "Откуда мне знать?", "timestamp": 1700200180}, {"message_id": "sg-02-m4", "author": "b", "text": "Ну я упоминал вроде.", "timestamp": 1700200300}, {"message_id": "sg-02-m5", "author": "a", "text": "Ты не упоминал.", "timestamp": 1700200360}, {"message_id": "sg-02-m6", "author": "b", "text": "Хорошо, значит не упоминал. Виноват.", "timestamp": 1700200480}, {"message_id": "sg-02-m7", "author": "a", "text": "Меня не «виноват» волнует, а что так каждый раз.", "timestamp": 1700200660}, {"message_id": "sg-02-m8", "author": "b", "text": "Понимаю. Давай я буду сразу писать в календарь.", "timestamp": 1700200780}, {"message_id": "sg-02-m9", "author": "a", "text": "Давай попробуем.", "timestamp": 1700200900}], "candidate_boundaries": ["sg-02-m1|sg-02-m2", "sg-02-m2|sg-02-m3", "sg-02-m3|sg-02-m4", "sg-02-m4|sg-02-m5", "sg-02-m5|sg-02-m6", "sg-02-m6|sg-02-m7", "sg-02-m7|sg-02-m8", "sg-02-m8|sg-02-m9"]}
